step Highperch
  zone Thousand Needles
  tip Down the Great Lift into Thousand Needles, then west to the wyverns' cliffs at Highperch. Every wyvern there can drop a venom sac. Careful: wait on the platform until the lift is level with it before you step on, and stay on it until it stops; the drop beside it kills.
  collect 5809 quest 1135 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Highperch Venom Sac

