step Mirage Raceway: kill these as you meet them
  zone Thousand Needles
  tip Rocket Car Rubble lies all over the flats. Scorpid Reavers and Salt Flats Scavengers roam the north half, Sparkleshell Tortoises (30-31) the middle of the flats: hunt them for the shells. Careful: Sparkleshell Snappers (34-35) wander the whole flats, and the Saltstone Gazers (34-35) and Scorpid Terrors (33-34) hold the far south: leave them and keep to the north half.
  collect 5794 quest 1104 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Salty Scorpid Venom
  collect 5848 quest 1176 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Hollow Vulture Bone
  collect 5795 quest 1105 @76.4,58.2 map 1441 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Hardened Tortoise Shell, from the Sparkleshell Tortoises
  collect 5798 quest 1110 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Rocket Car Parts

